FAMEChat installation leaflet
-----------------------------

To Install FAMEChat, just Create a directory (called FAMEChat, for example :^)
into your FAME door directory. Copy FAMEChat.FIM to this new directory and
then start the System Editor for door configuration.

Note that future FAMEChat versions will put some data (files and/or sub dirs)
to the directory where FAMEChat.FIM itself is located. Better you really use
an own directory for FAMEChat if you dislike messed-up harddisks (however,
some people don't matter..).

FAMEChat Door Settings:

Cmd = BBSCmd

Door Type = FIM (MultiNode)

Stack Size = 4096 Bytes

Command Allow = NR -- -- -- --
		AR AC RD --

FAMEChat may reside resident. Refer to the FAME manual for how about to
install FAME and doors resident.

FAMEChat currently doesn't parse any arguments. Calling FAMEChat auto-joins
the User into multi chat "room" #1.

While being in Chat, User Commands are Control qualified hotkey commands.
Control-x leaves FAMEChat, Control-z (^Z) shows a command summary.

